bf90bfcfbf" :question/math-academy-id "q-78011" :question/problem "Margaret is studying and analyzing a culture of bacteria. From a certain moment, she notices that the number of bacteria $B(t)$ in the culture grows according to the formula $B(t)=500\\cdot {2}^{t},$ where $t$ denotes the time in hours. How many bacteria will there be after $4$ hours?" :question/worked-solution "To get the number of bacteria in the culture after $4$ hours, we evaluate the function at $t=4.$ Substituting $t=4$ into the function $B(t)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =500\\cdot (2)^{(4)} \\\\  & =500\\cdot 16 \\\\  & =8\\,000.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, there will be $8\\,000$ bacteria in the culture after $4$ hours." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-340fbdbc-1d06-5b42-ac2d-473bb2673492"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-340fbdbc-1d06-5b42-ac2d-473bb2673492" :answer-field/id #uuid "340fbdbc-1d06-5b42-ac2d-473bb2673492" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-abaf773d-4371-5f2a-80e7-d98c7190b007" :answer-field/choices ["answer-12a71d6a-5ce8-5979-a343-2093ca73b8b8" "answer-ce1b38b7-9a86-5be0-9fb2-4ba2d5446529" "answer-74786fdc-a52c-5700-81a6-37b58ddd953d" "answer-abaf773d-4371-5f2a-80e7-d98c7190b007" "answer-0b7dfae5-b1a0-5362-83b9-26d68e7d28fb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-12a71d6a-5ce8-5979-a343-2093ca73b8b8" :answer/id #uuid "12a71d6a-5ce8-5979-a343-2093ca73b8b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12\\,000" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ce1b38b7-9a86-5be0-9fb2-4ba2d5446529" :answer/id #uuid "ce1b38b7-9a86-5be0-9fb2-4ba2d5446529" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,000" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74786fdc-a52c-5700-81a6-37b58ddd953d" :answer/id #uuid "74786fdc-a52c-5700-81a6-37b58ddd953d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\,800" :db/ensure [