function of a discrete random variable $X$ is a function $F(x)$ such that\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\le x).\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(4) & =P(X\\le 4) \\\\  & =P(X\\in \\{0,1,…,4\\}) \\\\  & =P(X\\in \\{0\\})+P(X\\in \\{1,2,3,4\\}) \\\\  & =P(X\\le 0)+P(1\\le X\\le 4) \\\\  & =F(0)+P(1\\le X\\le 4).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(1\\le X\\le 4) & =F(4)-F(0) \\\\  & =0.8153-0.0498 \\\\  & =0.7655.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-de4d3525-6787-5129-8466-0e3b6a451cdf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-de4d3525-6787-5129-8466-0e3b6a451cdf" :answer-field/id #uuid "de4d3525-6787-5129-8466-0e3b6a451cdf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5511111d-5afd-5b22-bb89-1ea91a4838c3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ca8aa39f-446f-5831-af5e-ebb6ebecaa92" "answer-c293f896-5431-56fb-8b53-6b9eaa071c99" "answer-5511111d-5afd-5b22-bb89-1ea91a4838c3" "answer-568f563b-3443-50b8-bb56-4f2da7c0db5f" "answer-f589b1b7-5f83-5709-a135-a5673ac3bb61"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ca8aa39f-446f-5831-af5e-ebb6ebecaa92" :answer/id #uuid "ca8aa39f-446f-5831-af5e-ebb6ebecaa92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.6162" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c293f896-5431-56fb-8b53-6b9eaa071c99" :answer/id #uuid "c293f896-5431-56fb-8b53-6b9eaa071c99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.7170" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5511111d-5afd-5b22-bb89-1ea91a4838c3" :answer/id #uuid "5511111d-5afd-5b22-bb89-1ea91a4838c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.7655" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-568f563b-3443-50b8-bb56-4f2da7c0db5f" :answer/id #uuid "568f563b-3443-50b8-bb56-4f2da7c0db5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.8153" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f589b1b7-5f83-5709-a135-a5673ac3bb61" :answer/id #uuid "f589b1b7-5f83-5709-a135-a5673ac3bb61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.8663" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f97c8702-16dc-518f-875a-9b5c78750b8c" :question/id #uuid "f97c8702-16dc-518f-875a-9b5c78750b8c" :question/math-academy-id "q-224965" :question/problem "Using the cumulative distribution function table of the Poisson random variable $X∼\\text{Po}(4)$ given below, compute $P(3<X\\le 7).$\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ | $7$ | $8$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $P(X\\le x)$ | $\\,0.2381\\,$ | $\\,0.4335\\,$ | $\\,0.6288\\,$ | $\\,0.7851\\,$ | $\\,0.8893\\,$ | $\\,0.9489\\,$ | $\\,0.9786\\,$ |" :question/worked-solution "The cumulative distribution function of a discrete random variable $X$ is a function $F(x)$ such that\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\le x).\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(7) & =P(X\\le 7) \\\\  & =P(X\\in \\{0,1,…,7\\}) \\\\  & =P(X\\in \\{0,1,2,3\\})+P(X\\in \\{4,5,6,7\\}) \\\\  & =P(X\\le 3)+P(3<X\\le 7) \\\\  & =F(3)+P(3<X\\le 7).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(3<X\\le 7) & =F(7)-F(3) \\\\  & =0.9489-0.4335 \\\\  & =0.5154.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-eb9b6fe0-9e0e-55d1-807b-86e15edd4fae"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-eb9b6fe0-9e0e-55d1-807b-86e15edd4fae" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb9b6fe0-9e0e-55d1-807b-86e15edd4fae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-df40732a-9e2e-5e0c-bf2d-69ad5340e4a1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1d179069-c017-58b3-9681-83c19b40173a" "answer-d0965698-05e5-51b1-b407-9a7f58296fee" "answer-df40732a-9e2e-5e0c-bf2d-69ad5340e4a1" "answer-4e5423c0-285d-57a6-9979-2880e8d5ce6a" "answer-309d8cdc-a45a-5ab5-9a3b-49832ed6d041"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1d179069-c017-58b3-9681-83c19b40173a" :answer/id #uuid "1d179069-c017-5